/**
 * @page workflow Development workflow
 * @brief The make targets used to check, test, build and document the code.
 *
 * @section wf_stages Stages
 *
 * Lintra provides the following makefile targets:
 *
 * | Target        | Purpose                                            |
 * |---------------|----------------------------------------------------|
 * | `make format` | Format the sources with clang-format               |
 * | `make lint`   | Check MISRA C:2012 compliance with cppcheck        |
 * | `make test`   | Run the unit tests with Ceedling and gather coverage |
 * | `make build`  | Build the project with strict compiler flags       |
 * | `make docs`   | Generate this documentation with Doxygen           |
 *
 * @section wf_docs Documenting code
 *
 * Public headers are documented with Doxygen. Groups, pages and the main page
 * live in the `doxygen/` folder.
 */
